# Bunker 2, speedrun route. Bond starts unarmed in a locked cell (door key 0x1, the key on the floor outside at
# -3288,167,4993). The magnet watch pulls it in - reliably, from one spot (round 7):
#   - the pull starts when Z is RELEASED (chrprop.c: holding fire keeps resetting magnetattracttime to 0); from 60 fields
#     after release until the hum ends (250) anything within 350 (horizontal) whose floor line from Bond is clear comes
#     in (propobj.c, stanTestLineUnobstructed and the item's own tile);
#   - round 6 held Z for 3 s and then walked off toward pad 99 (outside the cell: never reached), so the window passed
#     with Bond on the move by the door, where the line runs into the wall. From -3215,4700, standing still, the key came
#     in on every seed tried (1-6).
# After the cell the normal bot's movement (`slow`): with the speedrun movement 2 of 6 seeds died in the fights of
# rooms 61 / 6; slow: 5 of 5 complete (127-212 s).
name bunker2
slow equip watchmagnetattract
slow goto -3215 157 4700 20
slow face -3288 120 4993
slow press z 4
slow wait 200
slow obj=1 collect obj 2
slow key 0x2
slow use obj 3 120
slow auto
slow goto pad 51 40
exit
